From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: timvdhoorn <timvdhoorn@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 22 Nov 2026 13:25:37 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 17/18] perf: build the quiet thread list from the shell index

A list over one point atom per thread rebuilt once per thread a snapshot
changed. With idle subagents kept in the shell (nest agent-opened child
threads) that is ~3800 rebuilds and blocked the mobile app for 30 s
after a cold start.
